{
  "info": {
    "name": "Prode UTN - TPI Programacion 4",
    "_postman_id": "prode-utn-tpi4-2026",
    "description": "Coleccion de la API del Prode (UTN FRVM).\n\nUSO RAPIDO:\n1) Ejecutar 'Auth > Login' (guarda {{token}} automaticamente en la variable de coleccion).\n2) Los demas requests ya usan 'Authorization: Bearer {{token}}'.\n\nNOTA HTTPS: el backend corre con certificado autofirmado. En Postman desactivar 'Settings > General > SSL certificate verification'. Si se corre con SSL_ENABLED=false, cambiar la variable baseUrl a http://localhost:8080.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "https://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register (publico)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"nuevo_user\",\n  \"email\": \"nuevo@prode.local\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "register"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (guarda token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data && data.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', data.token);",
                  "  console.log('Token guardado en {{token}}');",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.log('La respuesta no trajo token');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"usernameOrEmail\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"CAMBIAR_POR_LA_DEL_.env\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" } ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "me"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Equipos",
      "item": [
